[[0,1742920,0,2,0,2,"2017-03-24T12:43:14","madmalloy","",[],"","What Is This? Secret Wikileaks Footage Claims to Show Mysterious Black Knight Satellite Being Shot Down","http://www.thedailysheeple.com/what-is-this-secret-wikileaks-footage-claims-to-show-mysterious-black-knight-satellite-being-shot-down_032017","Conspiracy"],[1,8531095,0,1,0,1,"2017-03-24T13:20:11","NeedleStack","",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>Now, new footage sent to Wikileaks on a secret server purports to show “something” being shot out of the sky in space, and many in the UFO conspiracy community believe it might be the Black Knight Satellite.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Where is the proof that this was sent to WikiLeaks? </p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Secret Wikileaks Footage</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Where has WikiLeaks published this? Is the assertion that someone from within WikiLeaks &quot;leaked&quot; this?</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>the legend is that it’s a 13,000-year-old alien satellite sent to this planet by an alien race to control humanity</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Sounds reasonable. </p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It was detected back in the 1940s, but some claim Nikola Tesla picked up a strange radio signal off of it back in 1899 that was picked up again in 1926 and so on.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Source link?</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>NASA officially claims it’s just space junk</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Link?</p>"],[2,8531110,8531095,0,1,-1,"2017-03-24T13:22:30","madmalloy","",[],"<p>Dig away if it interests you.</p>"],[3,8531159,8531110,2,0,2,"2017-03-24T13:29:10","NeedleStack","",[],"<p>Bullshit. This article provides no evidence or one link in support of its claims. Everything in this &quot;article&quot; is fantasy until proven otherwise. The onus is on them to back up their claims.</p>"],[1,8531860,0,1,0,1,"2017-03-24T14:46:17","Tallest_Skil","",[],"<p>I would downvote this, but I am told by the website that I cannot denounce lies more often than I support fact, so this post stands in for my downvote.</p>\n<p>Fuck this shit.<